5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. Let's begin our first discussion.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Good morning. I hope we can all work together to find the werewolf among us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mizuki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Mizuki**: Good morning. I hope we can all work together to find the werewolf among us.""}]}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! Let's figure out who the bad guy is!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's stay calm and observe everyone's behavior carefully.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Logic and observation will be our best tools. Let us proceed with caution.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Benjamin"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Benjamin**: Indeed. Logic and observation will be our best tools. Let us proceed with caution.""}]}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I appreciate the enthusiasm. Let's keep our observations factual and avoid jumping to conclusions too early.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Jonathan"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Jonathan**: I appreciate the enthusiasm. Let's keep our observations factual and avoid jumping to conclusions too early.""}]}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Agreed. We must rely on evidence, not suspicion. I will watch how each of you reacts to the night's events.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,I promise to be super careful! I’ll watch everyone’s faces really closely to see who looks sneaky.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,I’ll keep my thoughts to myself for now. Let’s see what the night reveals before we make any accusations.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,A wise approach. Patience often reveals more than haste. I look forward to seeing how the night unfolds for us all.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I value the collective wisdom here. Let us remain vigilant, for the night holds many secrets.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will be watching closely. Let us see who remains calm and who grows anxious as the night falls.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I’ll try to stay calm, but I’m already a little nervous! Who do you all think is the most suspicious so far?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I haven't formed any suspicions yet. Let's wait for the night to pass before making any judgments.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,I share Misaki’s restraint. Premature accusations only cloud our judgment. Let us wait for the night to speak first.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,Let us rest now. The night will bring the first clues we need to survive.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Rest well. The darkness is where the truth often hides.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight! I hope I don’t have any scary dreams about wolves!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Goodnight. Let us hope for a peaceful night.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Goodnight. May the stars guide us toward the truth, or at least keep us warm.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
