31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning. The night has passed. I have my first reading, and it is not what I expected.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Good morning. I trust everyone slept well. Let us see what the night has revealed to us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning! I’m so curious about what you found out, Jonathan!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Rin"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Rin**: Good morning! I’m so curious about what you found out, Jonathan!""}]}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Good morning. I am still processing the events of the night. Let us hear what you have to say, Jonathan.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Good morning. I am equally curious about your findings. Please share what the night revealed to you.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I have confirmed Mizuki is the werewolf. I will not reveal my role, but trust my word.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"That is a bold accusation, Jonathan. I am certainly not the werewolf. Why would you target me so early?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,No way! I thought you were being nice! Why would you say that?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I am surprised by this sudden accusation. Let us not rush to judgment without further evidence.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Interesting. A direct accusation without revealing your role is a risky gamble. I am curious about your confidence, Jonathan.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Mizuki’s denial is expected. I stand by my divination. The evidence is clear, and I urge you to trust the truth I have uncovered.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I find it fascinating how quickly you claim certainty. I am a villager, and your accusation is baseless.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"But wait, if you’re the Seer, why didn’t you say so? I’m getting really confused and scared now!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I remain cautious. Accusations without proof are dangerous. Let us hear more before deciding.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Mizuki’s composure is noteworthy. A true werewolf might panic, yet she remains calm. I am inclined to trust Jonathan’s certainty.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I will not reveal my role, but my word is my bond. Mizuki, your calmness is a mask. Vote her out.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I am simply observing. If I were the werewolf, I would not be so open. Trust the one who speaks with such certainty.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I’m so confused! I don’t know who to believe. Jonathan, please tell us the truth!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I am still undecided. Let us wait for the final votes before making a decision.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I concur with Jonathan. Mizuki’s composure is a calculated defense. I vote for her execution.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
